WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.332
Sidorenko's conjecture, disproved.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.533
Sidorenko said random graphs hold the fewest copies of any two-sided pattern.

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.261
A finite-field construction makes this pattern rarer,

4
00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:13.622
and a sampled graph keeps it rare.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.855
Claimed: a host with fewer copies than random.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.016
Main theorem in Lean.
